<Defs>
  <XenotypeDef>
    <defName>LP_Troll</defName>
    <label>巨魔</label>
    <description>曾被培育为恶劣环境中的近战生物兵器。巨魔有橄榄绿色皮肤、宽阔的下颌、尖耳和魁梧身躯；成年后体型约为普通人的1.5倍，普通衣甲与武器会随身体一起显示。巨魔以大量食物维持血肉再生，生来带有原版“强健消化”，吃生食毫不在意；饱食时伤口会迅速愈合，失血、旧伤疤和失去的体外部位也能慢慢恢复。火焰和酸液会暂时阻断再生；死去的巨魔只要尸体没被火烧、没有腐烂、大脑还在，约一天后就会重新站起来。</description>
    <descriptionShort>高大而贪食的绿色近战异种人，生食不掉心情。饱食时再生，不烧掉尸体就会复活；火焰会阻断再生。</descriptionShort>
    <iconPath>Troll/TrollAppearance</iconPath>
    <inheritable>true</inheritable>
    <combatPowerFactor>1.8</combatPowerFactor>
    <factionlessGenerationWeight>0</factionlessGenerationWeight>
    <genes>
      <li>LP_TrollRegeneration</li>
      <li>LP_TrollAppearance</li>
      <li>Skin_Green</li>
      <li>Body_Hulk</li>
      <li>Ears_Pointed</li>
      <li>Jaw_Heavy</li>
      <li>Brow_Heavy</li>
      <li>Hair_BaldOnly</li>
      <li>Beard_NoBeardOnly</li>
      <li>MeleeDamage_Strong</li>
      <li>Robust</li>
      <li>DarkVision</li>
      <li>MoveSpeed_Slow</li>
      <li>AptitudePoor_Shooting</li>
    </genes>
  </XenotypeDef>
  <GeneDef>
    <defName>LP_TrollAppearance</defName>
    <label>巨魔巨躯与獠牙</label>
    <description>巨魔的獠牙与高大身躯。注意：这个基因不只是外观，它决定巨魔的1.5倍实际体型，移除后负重、食量、被命中概率等都会回到普通人水平。绿色皮肤、健壮体型、尖耳、厚下颌、浓眉和无发外貌由原版异种人基因提供。体型随年龄长大，成年后实际身体与整个人物渲染达到普通人的1.5倍。普通服装、护甲与武器仍可穿戴和显示。体型越大，生命和近战越强（见巨躯规则：成年生命总量×125%、近战伤害×115%）。</description>
    <geneClass>LichPhylactery.Gene_TrollAppearance</geneClass>
    <iconPath>Troll/TrollAppearance</iconPath>
    <displayCategory>Miscellaneous</displayCategory>
    <biostatCpx>2</biostatCpx>
    <biostatMet>0</biostatMet>
    <selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight>
    <renderNodeProperties>
      <li>
        <nodeClass>PawnRenderNode_AttachmentHead</nodeClass>
        <workerClass>PawnRenderNodeWorker_FlipWhenCrawling</workerClass>
        <texPath>Troll/Tusks/TrollTusks</texPath>
        <parentTagDef>Head</parentTagDef>
        <visibleFacing><li>South</li><li>East</li><li>West</li></visibleFacing>
        <rotDrawMode>Fresh, Rotting</rotDrawMode>
        <baseLayer>52</baseLayer>
      </li>
    </renderNodeProperties>
    <customEffectDescriptions>
      <li>成年实际体型（影响负重、食量、被命中概率）与人物整体外观：×150%。</li>
      <li>巨胃：成年饱食度上限×150%，一顿撑得更久。</li>
      <li>增加巨魔獠牙；其余外貌由原版基因组合形成。</li>
      <li>保留普通人形装备锚点，可以穿戴常规服装与护甲。</li>
    </customEffectDescriptions>
  </GeneDef>
  <GeneDef>
    <defName>LP_TrollRegeneration</defName>
    <label>巨魔再生</label>
    <description>巨魔的血肉以惊人的速度再生。饱食度不低于50%时，每约4秒修复0.5点伤势（优先正在流血的伤口），并逐渐补回失血；每约5天消除一处旧伤疤（大脑除外）；失去的体外部位会长回，手臂、腿约3天，手指、眼睛等小部位约1天。修复会额外消耗饱食度，正在再生时饥饿速度×200%，平时×120%。受到火焰或酸液伤害、或身上着火时，再生停止6小时。死亡后，若死前6小时内没被火焰或酸液伤到、大脑完好，尸体保持新鲜约1天后原地复活；尸体被火烧、火化、屠宰或腐烂则不会复活。</description>
    <geneClass>LichPhylactery.Gene_TrollRegeneration</geneClass>
    <iconPath>Troll/TrollRegeneration</iconPath>
    <displayCategory>Healing</displayCategory>
    <biostatCpx>3</biostatCpx>
    <biostatMet>0</biostatMet>
    <selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight>
    <customEffectDescriptions>
      <li>饥饿速度：平时×120%，再生中×200%；每修复1点伤势额外消耗0.005饱食度。</li>
      <li>饱食时快速愈合，优先止血并补回失血；免疫获得速度×150%。</li>
      <li>每约5天消除一处旧伤疤（大脑除外）。</li>
      <li>体外部位会长回：手臂、腿约3天，手指、眼睛等约1天；内脏不会长回。</li>
      <li>受到火焰或酸液伤害、或身上着火时，6小时内停止再生。</li>
      <li>死后约1天复活（可在模组设置中关闭或限制次数）；火焰、火化、屠宰、腐烂或大脑被毁会阻止复活。</li>
    </customEffectDescriptions>
  </GeneDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>LP_TrollMetabolism</defName>
    <label>巨魔代谢</label>
    <description>快速再生所需的旺盛代谢。</description>
    <hediffClass>LichPhylactery.Hediff_TrollMetabolism</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>LP_TrollRegrowth</defName>
    <label>再生中的残肢</label>
    <description>巨魔的血肉正在长出失去的部位。括号中显示正在长回的部位和进度；饥饿或火焰会让进度暂停。</description>
    <hediffClass>LichPhylactery.Hediff_TrollRegrowth</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>0.01</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <everCurableByItem>false</everCurableByItem>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>LP_TrollRevivalWeakness</defName>
    <label>再生虚弱</label>
    <description>这只巨魔刚从死亡中重新长合，身体还没有完全恢复。</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <isBad>true</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.8, 0.6, 0.4)</defaultLabelColor>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HediffCompProperties_Disappears">
        <disappearsAfterTicks>120000~120000</disappearsAfterTicks>
        <showRemainingTime>true</showRemainingTime>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
            <offset>-0.2</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Moving</capacity>
            <offset>-0.2</offset>
          </li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
</Defs>
